  "bodyHash": "nT/YgLiFD5o=",
  "content": "<h2>适用于 Create 6.0.6 的 1.21.1 版本现已发布！</h2><p>本模组是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力：工艺与附加</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力</a>的扩展。</p><p>它添加了电子元件的拟真合成配方。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>特色内容：</strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Q8gMMGl\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Q8gMMGl\" alt=\"\"></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>新增物品：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/dtn6bx6N/ccap-items-2.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">碳刷</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">滑环</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">长金导线</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">长银铜合金导线</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">长铜导线</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">磁铁</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">铜线圈</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>合成配方</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/FHRpNVnr/recipe-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"566\" height=\"354\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/k5RytXmL/recipe-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"564\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/dVxB1Zz8/recipe-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"563\" height=\"352\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">线轴合成新方式：绕线</span></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>当主手持有<strong>导线</strong>，</p>\n<p>副手持<strong>可绕线</strong>物品时...</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/5ygcdtYX/coiling.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"657\"></p>\n<p>会出现<strong>操作提示</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>右键点击</strong>推动进度条...</p>\n<p>即可获得<strong>绕好线的线轴</strong>！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Gtd05D20/coiling-2.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"314\"></p>\n<p>可使用<strong>机械手</strong>实现自动化。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/BZBf1mYJ/coiling-recipe.png\" width=\"960\" height=\"463\"></p>\n</div><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">雷电方块转化</span></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在地面放置<strong>铜线圈</strong>。</p>\n<p>当附近有闪电时，有几率转化为<strong>磁铁</strong>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/NfGq8RSm/magnet.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"657\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>这是一个使用MCreator制作的简易模组。</p><div style=\"display:none\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"display:none\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"display:none\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"display:none\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"display:none\">&nbsp;</div>",
